# A part that cannot go on the wire (here a NUL) is not printed as sent:
# the console says why and the channel shows nothing new.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
! type #c fine
> PRIVMSG #c fine
? line #c <textual> fine
! type #c bad\x00line
? notice Not sent: contains CR, LF or NUL
? line #c <textual> fine
? registered textual
